 1239                   ;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 1240                   ; Write one IDE/CF-card sector (256 bytes)
 1241                   ;
 1242                   ; Address of data in HL
 1243                   ; LBA bits 0 to 7 passed in C
 1244                   ; LBA bits 8 to 15 passed in B
 1245                   ; LBA bits 16 to 23 passed in E
 1246                   
 1247 F5C7              IDEWR:
